{
  "title": "Bus Driver",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Drum-bus glue. Six",
        "knobs, transparent",
        "until you touch it.",
        "",
        "With every control at",
        "its default the stage",
        "is skipped entirely,",
        "so it costs nothing",
        "and passes audio",
        "bit-for-bit."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Controls",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Compress",
          "lines": [
            "One knob over a",
            "coordinated program:",
            "threshold -4 to -38",
            "dBFS, ratio 0.06 to a",
            "full limit, release",
            "115 down to 55 ms.",
            "",
            "Attack stays near",
            "11 ms at every",
            "setting so the beater",
            "click gets through.",
            "",
            "It can only ever turn",
            "things down. Makeup",
            "is measured from the",
            "audio, not predicted."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Crunch",
          "lines": [
            "Full-band saturation.",
            "Soft knee, a cubic",
            "term for grit, and a",
            "deliberate asymmetry",
            "so it makes even",
            "harmonics too, which",
            "is what reads as",
            "warmth rather than",
            "fuzz.",
            "",
            "Level-matched and",
            "DC-blocked, so it",
            "adds colour without",
            "adding level."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Attack",
          "lines": [
            "Bipolar, centre is",
            "off. Shapes the onset",
            "and nothing else -",
            "the tail does not",
            "move.",
            "",
            "Up sharpens, down",
            "softens, by about",
            "15 dB either way on",
            "a sharp hit.",
            "",
            "It is program",
            "dependent: a slow",
            "swell gets about half",
            "the treatment of a",
            "real hit."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Sustain",
          "lines": [
            "Bipolar, centre is",
            "off. Shapes the decay",
            "and nothing else -",
            "the onset does not",
            "move.",
            "",
            "Up lengthens the tail,",
            "down shortens it, by",
            "about -8 to +12 dB.",
            "",
            "Attack and Sustain are",
            "independent: set one",
            "without disturbing",
            "the other."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Dry/Wet",
          "lines": [
            "A blend across the",
            "whole stage, so",
            "anything under 100%",
            "is parallel",
            "compression: the",
            "untouched signal with",
            "the squashed one",
            "underneath it.",
            "",
            "Often the best glue",
            "setting is a heavy",
            "Compress blended",
            "back at 30-50%."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Output",
          "lines": [
            "Trim after everything,",
            "-24 to +12 dB.",
            "",
            "The automatic makeup",
            "is capped at +15 dB",
            "and only tracks real",
            "signal, so a heavily",
            "compressed bus can",
            "come back short and a",
            "crunch-only setting",
            "can run hot. This is",
            "where you match it."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Signal order",
      "lines": [
        "Attack, then Sustain,",
        "then Crunch, then",
        "Compress, then makeup,",
        "then Output.",
        "",
        "Transient shaping runs",
        "before the compressor,",
        "so what you sharpen is",
        "what the compressor",
        "then has to catch."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "MIDI",
      "lines": [
        "None. Bus Driver has no",
        "MIDI surface - it only",
        "processes audio."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
